<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide wins Badenwerk order.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide wins Badenwerk order.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial gases group Air Liquide said on Wednesday it had won a contract to supply oxygen to a waste processing plant planned by Germany's Badenwerk.</p>
<p>The plant to be built in Karlsruhe, Germany, will treat 225,000 tonnes of household waste a year from January 1999, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details.</p>
</text>
